BT /F2 12.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 673.39 Tm (1. What the Skill does \(one sentence\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 654.39 Tm (care-circle turns one folder of medication photos, clinic letters and voice memos into a dated,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 639.89 Tm (source-cited doctor-visit brief and a sibling update, computed on the NAS.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 613.39 Tm (2. Who is the target user and problem?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 594.39 Tm (Adult children caring for an ageing parent. Evidence is scattered across pill-bottle photos, discharge) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 579.89 Tm (summaries and unplayed voice memos, so every appointment is a scramble.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 553.39 Tm (3. What is your proposed solution?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 534.39 Tm (A local care brief that reads each modality with the matching UGOS expert and writes one dated) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 519.89 Tm (document: current medications with source files, label-versus-report conflicts, recent results, changes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 505.39 Tm (since the last visit, questions for the doctor, a five-line sibling update and an unreadable list. It never) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 490.89 Tm (diagnoses or advises dosage.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 464.39 Tm (4. What is the Core User Flow?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 445.39 Tm (The user names a care folder, the parent's name and the appointment date. The file expert enumerates) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 430.89 Tm (and deduplicates the folder. The photo expert reads medication labels. The document expert extracts) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 416.39 Tm (clinic letters and compares each medication against its label. The knowledge expert transcribes voice) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 401.89 Tm (memos. The brief is approved, written back and its sources tagged.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 375.39 Tm (5. What substantive difference does your idea offer compared with existing tools or conventional AI solutions?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 356.39 Tm (Existing tools are static inventories, expiry diffs or single-modal cloud assistants. None reads a pill bottle) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 341.89 Tm (with on-device vision, transcribes the parent's voice, extracts the clinic letter and binds every claim to its) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 327.39 Tm (source file. Health data never leaves the NAS, and the brief is written back with sources tagged in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 312.89 Tm (place.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 286.39 Tm (6. Which UGREEN AI NAS capabilities will be used, and at which step in the workflow?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 267.39 Tm (Step 2: `ug-filesystem find`, `ug-filesystem ls`, `ug-filemgr scan-dedupe` \(file-agent\). Step 3: `ug-photo) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 252.89 Tm (vision-ocr`, `ug-photo vision-vlm` \(photo-agent\). Steps 4-5: `ug-document metadata`, `page-count`,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 238.39 Tm (`extract` schema `medical-report`, `qa` intent `comparison` \(document-agent\). Step 6: `ug-knowledge) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 223.89 Tm (audio-transcription` \(knowledge-agent\). Step 9: `ug-filesystem mkdir`. Step 10: `ug-knowledge) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 209.39 Tm (save-text`. Step 11: `ug-filemgr tag-get-by-name`, `tag-add`, `tag-add-file`.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 182.89 Tm (7. What was your technical approach?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 163.89 Tm (Pure Markdown orchestration. It delegates only through `delegate --target` to the four registered experts) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 149.39 Tm (in a fixed order, passing each step's real result downstream. Read steps are ungated; the brief) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 134.89 Tm (approval, folder creation, write and tags are approval-gated, never bypassed. Inputs are the folder, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 120.39 Tm (parent name and the date. The NAS local model performs vision, extraction and transcription; nothing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 105.89 Tm (leaves the device.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 79.39 Tm (8. What is the current development status?) Tj ET
